- **10 attempts. 5 produced by `etude gate` alone; all 5 escalated.**
- At SEAT granularity, which the approved plan also asked for and an earlier
  draft omitted: `etude gate` emitted **10 seat entries** (3 codex `go`, 2
  deterministic check `go`, 5 opus `failed`); the 5 bootstrap appends carried
